# TypeSafe API Reference Summary

## Base URL & Endpoint
**POST** `https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone`

**Authorization:** `Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>`

**Content-Type:** `application/json`

## Request Schema

```json
{
  "state": "string | object | array",
  "model": "jev-latest",
  "questions": {
    "question_id": {
      "type": "noul | choice | score",
      "instructions": "string | object | array",
      "criteria": {}
    }
  }
}
```

### Question Types

**Noul** (yes/no): Returns probability 0–1
```json
{
  "type": "noul",
  "instructions": "question text",
  "criteria": { "true": "yes definition", "false": "no definition" }
}
```

**Choice** (select one): Returns chosen option + probability distribution
```json
{
  "type": "choice",
  "instructions": "what to decide",
  "criteria": { "option1": "description", "option2": "description" }
}
```

**Score** (rating): Returns weighted value across levels
```json
{
  "type": "score",
  "instructions": "what to rate",
  "criteria": ["Level 0", "Level 1", "Level 2"]
}
```

Max 255 options per Choice; 2–10 levels per Score.

## Response Schema

```json
{
  "model": "jev-1.13.0",
  "answers": {
    "question_id": {
      "type": "noul | choice | score",
      "noul": 0.95,
      "choice": "option",
      "probabilities": { "key": 0.88 },
      "confidence": 0.81,
      "score": 1.05,
      "legend": { "0": "Level" }
    }
  },
  "usage": { "input_tokens": 296, "output_tokens": 20 }
}
```

## Error Codes

| Status | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| 401 | Missing/invalid API key |
| 422 | Validation failure (malformed request) |
| 429 | Rate limit exceeded—use exponential backoff |
| 529 | Service overloaded—retry with backoff |

**Note:** "Our client SDKs handle this automatically, so no extra handling is needed" for rate limit retries.

---

**Limits, batching, pricing, and max state length are not specified in the provided documentation.**

